    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">55 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Concurrency</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Asked at Walmart, Uber</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Locks, Conditions &amp; Semaphores</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Learn the five tools every thread-safe design is built from (mutex, condition, semaphore, latch, spinlock), when <code>synchronized</code> is enough and when you need <code>ReentrantLock</code>, how <code>tryLock</code> saves you from hanging forever, and why every wait sits inside a <code>while</code> loop.</p>\n"
